	)
	(text "Source: J. de Queiroz (2019), Fig. 1, the symmetrical unipolar generator\n  (docs/reference/deQueiroz-2019-analysis-electronic-electrostatic-generators.pdf).\nStage S0, frozen at commit 42747f4 (rebuild/s0_base/). REF = the paper's node 0, the\nvaricaps' common side.\nPolarity positive: every node at or above REF (DECIDED 2026-10-14).\nThe varicaps run 180 deg apart. In phase the doubler does not pump\n  (rebuild/s1_tube/s1-pulsed-core-findings.md).\nGain per cycle z = 1.372169 ideal, 1.372037 ngspice\n(rebuild/s0_base/s0_base_results.json).\nValues: the paper's example, 60-360 pF varicaps, Ca101 = Cb101 = 330 pF, 20 Hz. S1 gives\nthe tube's.\nNetlist checked node for node against TOPOLOGY (rebuild/s0_base/s0_base.py) and\ns0_base.cir\n  by rebuild/kicad/make_kicad.py (rebuild/kicad/kicad_check_results.json)."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 294.64 87.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e4cbf6a0-c3c7-5661-8c51-49e5c0fae3f7")
	)
